				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "613f8869-4f84-4f0a-9494-3c79fcfc09bb")
	)
	(text "SHEET GUIDE / 3400_NEGATIVE_RAIL_MONITOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 19.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f6d5398-e394-41ca-8c74-61461350aee7")
	)
	(text "Channel B gives MON_V_N15 = -0.1 x N15: -15 V becomes +1.50 V.\nEach telemetry branch uses 10 kOhm and 100 nF: tau = 1.0 ms.\nWith the 3200 threshold AON/5.7, the nominal trip is 0.288 A\nat AON = 3.28 V. Preserve the four 0.1% gain-network resistors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79909a83-2bab-4140-8559-24f997b90320")
	)
	(text "Negative current sensing\n20 x (N15 - N15_RAW); 2.0 V/A with R1107 = 0.1 Ohm.\nOC_I_N15 bypasses the telemetry RC filter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "94471288-cdd3-43d4-9d5a-5af319b67bf0")
	)
	(text "3400_NEGATIVE_RAIL_MONITOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9773e136-4a57-449c-b2a4-3a5e6f98407d")
	)
	(text "Protection and fault response"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b8fbd874-ce0f-4c66-ac9c-4d710c81af27")
	)
	(text "D3401-D3403 clamp the signal nodes toward GND and AON;\nseries resistors limit sustained clamp current. This sheet senses\nconditions; the comparator and interlock sheets disconnect power.\nThreshold accuracy needs an error budget. Treat rail transitions\nand AON loss as invalid telemetry states until supplies settle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d1d7c96f-92e6-423f-86cf-ea56220c2169")
	)
	(text "The monitor has no enable or permit input. Channel A produces\n20 x (N15 - N15_RAW), or nominally 2.0 V/A of return current.\nOC_I_N15 reaches the comparator through R3407 without the\ntelemetry capacitor. MON_I_N15 uses a separate filtered branch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 91.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dd226521-cef3-40eb-8488-c35301627871")
	)
	(text "Timing and settings"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec195fda-1da1-4544-8c85-af76b22208bc")
	)
	(text "U3401 monitors the negative AFE supply used by MIRA matrix drivers.\nIt translates the rail voltage and shunt drop into positive signals.\nMON_I_N15 and MON_V_N15 feed power-controller telemetry;\nOC_I_N15 feeds the independent hardware overcurrent comparator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f8408a0f-1c1b-426d-bdd3-50ff52992d19")
	)
